(*
Test case: TC_CART_001 - Add a desktop computer to the shopping cart
Source: input/nopcommerce_test_cases_download.xlsx

Uses the installed Studio visible-text click and wait patterns.
Requires the SUT to be open on the nopCommerce storefront.
*)

-- Steps 1-2: Open the Computers category.
WaitFor 10, text:"Computers"
Click text:"Computers", waitFor:10

-- Step 3: Open Desktops.
WaitFor 10, text:"Desktops"
Click text:"Desktops", waitFor:10

-- Step 4: Open the exact product rather than using one of the repeated
-- Add to cart controls on the listing.
WaitFor 10, text:"Digital Storm VANQUISH Custom Performance PC"
Click text:"Digital Storm VANQUISH Custom Performance PC", waitFor:10
WaitFor 10, text:"Digital Storm Vanquish 3 Desktop PC"

-- Step 5: The product price is observed at runtime and is not a fixed
-- expected value in the workbook.

-- Step 6: On the uniquely identified product page, add the product once.
WaitFor 10, text:"ADD TO CART"
Click text:"ADD TO CART", waitFor:10

-- Step 7: Verify the expected success notification after adding the product.
WaitFor 10, text:"The product has been added to your shopping cart"
